  <p>The Game is suitable for all ages. The first time you open it, it asks for your birth year to adjust ads and available services. If you are a minor under the laws of your country, you must use the Game with the knowledge of your parent or legal guardian and ask their permission before making any purchase. Parents and guardians will find more information in the <a href="families.html">Notice for Families</a>.</p>

