  <p>We grant you a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install and use the Game on your own devices for personal, non-commercial use. You may not copy, modify, decompile, reverse engineer, distribute, sublicense, or create derivative works of the Game, except to the extent expressly permitted by applicable law.</p>

