  <p>To resume your game on another phone, you can create a <strong>recovery code</strong> in <strong>Settings → Backup</strong>. Anyone who has the code can access your Game account, so you are responsible for keeping it safe and not sharing it. We will never ask you for it by message or email. If you lose it, we cannot regenerate it.</p>

